## 8. C4 container checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + inventory source
- [ ] Every container observed in real infra (`docker ps`, `kubectl get pods`)
- [ ] Tech/version per container matches deployed artifact (image digest)
- [ ] Communication protocols confirmed by config or pcap
- [ ] >=50% of containers are `[verified]`

### Coverage

- [ ] All containers in the diagram are listed in section 1
- [ ] Each container has tech + responsibility + scaling unit
- [ ] Data stores called out separately (ContainerDb)
- [ ] Communication arrows specify protocol AND direction AND sync/async
- [ ] Diagram renders cleanly (<= 12 nodes total)
- [ ] Deployment topology captured (min/max replicas, node selectors)
- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/wiki/c4-container.md`
- [ ] Cross-link from `wiki/index.md` works